@19001 = ~Acid Elemental~
@19002 = ~The Acid Comes Alive~
@19003 = ~Raging Render~
@19004 = ~*When you arrive in the area, a voice begins to echo in your head. It says: "Welcome to the Maze, adventurers. Don't bother looking for the exit: there isn't one. Don't look for the boss either: there isn't one. To earn your rune, all you have to do is survive for ten minutes. But don't think it'll be easy. Do you know the Render? We owe this marvel of nature to the twisted experiments carried out at Darkhold. For my challenge, I've reproduced it, improved it, and multiplied it. There are three of them here, and they have only one thing in mind: tearing you all to shreds. They're powerful, deadly, enraged, and immortal. Don't try to kill them; they'll simply be recreated at the center of the maze. So... let the hunt begin!" When the voice falls silent, you know what remains to be done.*~
@19005 = ~"Still alive? Promising. I'll be waiting for you. Here's your rune; you may leave."~
